flowchart LR
    T[Measured workload trace] --> B[Train / calibration buckets]
    T --> H[Untouched holdout]
    B --> C[Validated candidate plans]
    C --> P[Pareto pruning]
    P --> S[Piecewise policy synthesis]
    S --> R{Dispatch rule}
    R -->|short prompt · c=1| A[Plan A]
    R -->|long prompt · c=1| D[Plan B]
    R -->|concurrent| V[Plan C]
    R -->|unsupported / drift| F[Correctness-proven fallback]
    S --> E[Amortization model]
    E --> S
    H --> Q[Holdout regret + quality audit]
    S --> Q
    Q -->|pass| O[Versioned deployment policy]
    Q -->|fail| B
